  "verified": false,
  "evidence": "All 20 verdicts Shay Green's spc_smp and spc_mem_access_times reach agree with values taken on a console, and gilyon's spctest, which tests every opcode but SLEEP and STOP, reports Success. Peter Lemon's seven SPC700 cartridges each report FAIL at their first check: the status word they store differs from what they expect in the interrupt flag alone, which this processor leaves set after a reset.",
  "howToSettleIt": "Settled for what Shay Green's and gilyon's cartridges reach. Peter Lemon's wait on what a reset leaves in the interrupt flag, which OPEN-QUESTIONS.md carries under what the part holds when it comes up."
